184
00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.526
Okay.

185
00:07:18.526 --> 00:07:19.359
Which is cool, but I--

186
00:07:19.359 --> 00:07:21.503
Do they cap on the boomers when they're in private?

187
00:07:22.389 --> 00:07:23.540
Yeah, I don't know.

188
00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:27.880
But this was my first stab at actually hosting

189
00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:28.870
