228
00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:45.903
It went well?

229
00:08:45.903 --> 00:08:47.670
Yeah I dug it, it was super fun.

230
00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:48.860
And everyone was into it?

231
00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:49.693
Yeah, I think so.

232
00:08:49.693 --> 00:08:51.160
I mean, I think it went really well

233
00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:53.303
