236
00:08:57.043 --> 00:08:57.876
Right.

237
00:08:57.876 --> 00:08:59.350
'Cause it's like, okay, it's up to you.

238
00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:01.010
Like, can you get these people excited?

239
00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:03.220
Can you make sure that they're holding their attention?

240
00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:04.940
Can you keep them entertained?

241
00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:07.540
Can you keep this thing moving on time,

242
00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:08.895
all that kind of stuff.

243
00:09:08.895 --> 00:09:09.728
Right.

244
00:09:09.728 --> 00:09:10.798
Like it was pretty cool.

245
00:09:10.798 --> 00:09:12.150
So anyway, that was really gratifying.

246
00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:12.983
Cool.

247
00:09:12.983 --> 00:09:14.180
I really wanna do more of that,

248
00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:17.480
